- `elevatesci.com`: Cloudflare-fronted HTTPS website responding with static-style HTML pages and CSS/JavaScript assets. Public page HTML links the widget JS on the agent subdomain.
- `agents.elevatesci.com`: Cloudflare-fronted HTTPS endpoint. The root provides an nginx Basic-auth challenge; embed paths serve an Express-powered AnythingLLM-branded HTML shell and a JavaScript asset. This establishes a reachable public endpoint, not its physical host, container, upstream architecture, workspace contents, or owner.
- Public content includes catalog/product, research/quality, policy, informational, contact and commercial-enquiry pages. Site menu/copy is evidence of presented features only—not fulfillment, payment, order processing, inventory, account access, or database capabilities.

